# Deployment upload filter for the AI service (railway up, run from this
# directory). Independent of .gitignore -- this repo's model artifacts and
# datasets are intentionally excluded from the public GitHub repo (see the
# root .gitignore notes), so a git-connected deploy would have no model to
# load. `railway up` instead uploads the local working directory directly,
# and this file scopes that upload to exactly what the deployed FastAPI
# service (src/ai_service) needs to serve real inference for the core
# fulfillment-risk + Decision Engine + recommendation paths, while
# deliberately excluding the ~3GB NLP/Jumia transformer weight exports --
# those load lazily on first /v1/nlp/analyze request and are wrapped in a
# try/except that returns HTTP 503 "NLP model unavailable" if the weights
# aren't present, which is the honest degraded state for this deployment
# (see requirements-deploy.txt for the matching dependency scoping).

# Local envs / caches
.venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.git/
.claude/

# Raw/processed datasets -- never needed at inference time
data/

# Large research-only artifacts not required for the deployed capabilities
artifacts/experiments/nlp/inference_exports/B2_MARBERT/
artifacts/experiments/nlp/inference_exports/C_AraBERT/
artifacts/experiments/nlp/inference_exports/C_MARBERT/
artifacts/experiments/nlp/inference_exports/E_MARBERT/
artifacts/experiments/jumia/

# Notebooks, docs, tests, dev-session checkpoints -- not needed at runtime
notebooks/
docs/
tests/
reports/checkpoints/*/
!reports/checkpoints/nlp_deployment_promotion_registry_v1_2026-08-14/

# Packaging/review clutter (already excluded from the public repo too)
PACKAGING_VERIFICATION*.txt
V2_PACKAGE_MANIFEST.json
V2_REVIEW_README.md
V3_PACKAGE_MANIFEST.json
V3_REVIEW_README.md

# Full research requirements.txt is not used for this deployment --
# requirements-deploy.txt is installed instead (see Dockerfile).
